s=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Claw_of_Vulkoor\" title=\"The Claw of Vulkoor\">The Claw of Vulkoor</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Vulkoor&#39;s_Might\" title=\"Named item sets\">Vulkoor's Might</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Vulkoor&#39;s_Might\" title=\"Named item sets\">Vulkoor's Might</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+20% Artifact bonus to Threat Generation<br />+3 Artifact bonus to Attack<br />+3 Artifact bonus to Damage</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +5</a></b>: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Strength.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate +10</a>:</b> Passive: +10 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Intimidate\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> skill.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Gloves_of_the_Claw.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Gloves_of_the_Claw.png/420px-Gloves_of_the_Claw.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"338\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Gloves_of_the_Claw.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Gloves_of_the_Claw\" title=\"Item:Epic Gloves of the Claw\">Epic Gloves of the Claw</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Drow warriors don these gloves before combat and are granted great power in battle. They claim the gloves are infused with Vulkoor's wrath.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816152305\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.112 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3455/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20196/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5111/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n138.12%  133.040     41 Template:IO\n100.00%   96.319      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   96.319      1 -total\n 96.82%   93.253      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 46.10%   44.408      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.26%   43.596      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 44.28%   42.649      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 43.29%   41.692      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.91%   23.033      5 Template:Popup\n 17.90%   17.245      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12653-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816152305 and revision id 631145. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
